  s5.addText("While population-level burden is lower for schizophrenia and bipolar disorder, individual severity and disability are disproportionately high. Schizophrenia contributes 210.2 DALYs per 100,000 — reflecting the severe disability associated with the condition.", {
    x: 0.87, y: 4.2, w: 8.35, h: 0.85,
